  "description": "Wrap bold tags <b> and </b> around substrings that match the given dictionary of words.",
  "target": "s = 'aaabbc', dict = ['aaa', 'aab', 'bc']",
  "pseudocode": "1. mask = new Array(s.length).fill(false)\n2. for word in dict:\n3.   start = s.indexOf(word)\n4.   while start != -1:\n5.     for i from start to start + word.length - 1: mask[i] = true\n6.     start = s.indexOf(word, start + 1)\n7. result = ''\n8. for i from 0 to s.length - 1:\n9.   if mask[i] and (i == 0 or !mask[i-1]): result += '<b>'\n10.  result += s[i]\n11.  if mask[i] and (i == s.length - 1 or !mask[i+1]): result += '</b>'",
